/**
  \defgroup org_mitk_gui_qt_segmentation_helper org.mitk.gui.qt.segmentation.helper
  \ingroup MITKPlugins

  \brief Registers the multi-label segmentation node descriptor.

  This plug-in contributes nothing to the user interface of its own. It replaces
  the built-in "MultiLabelSegmentation" node descriptor of
  QmitkNodeDescriptorManager with one that renders node thumbnails from the label
  colors of the segmentation.

  It activates eagerly so that the descriptor is in place before any view is
  created, and it is deliberately kept separate from org.mitk.gui.qt.segmentation
  so that eager activation does not pull the whole segmentation stack into every
  application start.
*/

/**
  \defgroup org_mitk_gui_qt_segmentation_helper_internal Internal
  \ingroup org_mitk_gui_qt_segmentation_helper

  \brief This subcategory includes the internal classes of the
  org.mitk.gui.qt.segmentation.helper plugin. Other plugins must not rely on these
  classes. They contain implementation details and their interface may change at
  any time. We mean it.
*/
